<div class=3D"markdown-heading">
<h2 class=3D"heading-element">Dependency Injection Container</h2>
<img src=3D"https://jobloop.instructure.com/courses/409/files/20551/preview=
" alt=3D"Dependency_Injection-1.excalidraw.png" data-api-endpoint=3D"https:=
//jobloop.instructure.com/api/v1/courses/409/files/20551" data-api-returnty=
pe=3D"File" loading=3D"lazy"></div>
<p><strong>Dependency Injection (DI)</strong> er en viktig funksjon i ASP.N=
ET Core. Vi snakket mer om Dependency Injection i sist side. Men det kan v=
=C3=A6re greit =C3=A5 repetere kjapt hva og hvordan:</p>
<ol>
<li>Vi definerer en service (f.eks. <strong>ITaskContext</strong>) i v=C3=
=A5r DI-container</li>
<li>Webbuilder legger servicen i containeren</li>
<li>N=C3=A5r et endepunkt trenger denne servicen, injiserer applikasjonen e=
n instans av den</li>
</ol>
<p>I Program.cs ser vi denne registreringen:</p>
<div class=3D"highlight highlight-source-cs notranslate position-relative o=
verflow-auto">
<div style=3D"color: #cccccc; background-color: #1f1f1f; font-family: Conso=
las, 'Courier New', monospace; font-size: 14px; line-height: 19px; white-sp=
ace: pre;">
<div><span style=3D"color: #9cdcfe;">builder</span><span style=3D"color: #d=
4d4d4;">.</span><span style=3D"color: #9cdcfe;">Services</span><span style=
=3D"color: #d4d4d4;">.</span><span style=3D"color: #dcdcaa;">AddSingleton</=
span><span style=3D"color: #d4d4d4;">&lt;</span><span style=3D"color: #4ec9=
b0;">ITaskContext</span><span style=3D"color: #d4d4d4;">, </span><span styl=
e=3D"color: #4ec9b0;">TaskContext</span><span style=3D"color: #d4d4d4;">&gt=
;();</span></div>
</div>
</div>
<p>Serviceleverand=C3=B8rene finnes i tre hovedvarianter:</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Singleton</strong>: Samme instans brukes gjennom hele applikasj=
onens levetid</li>
<li><strong>Scoped</strong>: Ny instans for hver HTTP-foresp=C3=B8rsel</li>
<li><strong>Transient</strong>: Ny instans hver gang den ettersp=C3=B8rres<=
/li>
</ul>
